 "_lisez_moi": "Hashtag library of the alert posts (decided Oct 28, 2026, Instagram reworked Nov 1, 2026 from a hashtag search study). X and Facebook: local word (mandatory), city, country in English, country in its own language when different, ONE Earthquake tag (#Earthquake) and a Seismic tag (rotating). Instagram: 6 tags at most (Instagram caps posts at 5 since Dec 2025 per most reports): local word, country or US state, #Earthquake+place (#EarthquakeJapan), one news tag from actu (#EarthquakeToday half the time), one Seismic tag, then #NaturalDisaster when destructive (USGS impact orange or red, or M7+) else the town. Volcano Instagram: local word, volcano (#MayonVolcano), state or province, country, one tag from generiques, one Volcanology tag. Weekly reel Instagram: #Earthquakes, Seismic tags, 3 places. Never #Earthquake and #Earthquakes together. #Tectonics optional, never automatic. No brand tag.",
